From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roshan Gautam <roshangautam07@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:17:40 +0545
Subject: [PATCH 58/60] deps: update archs files for openssl-3.0.22

After an OpenSSL source update, all the config files need to be
regenerated and committed by:

    $ make -C deps/openssl/config clean
    $ sed -i 's/#ifdef/%ifdef/g; s/#endif/%endif/g' \
        deps/openssl/openssl/crypto/perlasm/x86asm.pl
    $ make -C deps/openssl/config
    $ git add deps/openssl/config/archs
    $ git add deps/openssl/openssl
    $ git commit

Generated with the deps/openssl/config/Dockerfile builder image.
